    "While pristine digital scarcity (Bitcoin) represents a profound monetary innovation, the broader cryptocurrency ecosystem is filled with catastrophic Financial Landmines: speculative memecoins, fraudulent yield protocols, and centralized exchange collapses. Over ninety-five percent of aspiring crypto investors lose money because they succumb to the seductive delusion of quick riches, trading volatile speculative tokens rather than accumulating sound capital.",
