    "You have now mastered the individual characteristics of all Five Core Asset Classes: Broad-Market Equities, Fixed Income, Real Estate, Hard Commodities, and Digital Scarcity. The defining challenge of long-term wealth building is synthesizing these five components into a cohesive, balanced, and automated system: The All-Weather Portfolio Architecture.",
