    "Configure an Automated Recurring Bank Sweep. Instruct your bank to automatically transfer one hundred dollars (or whatever your monthly investment target is) to your brokerage account on the first business day of every month, immediately after your primary paycheck arrives. This is the timeless principle of Paying Yourself First.",
