    "The crown jewel of tax-advantaged investing for young wealth builders is The Roth IRA (Individual Retirement Arrangement). A Roth IRA is an investment account funded with after-tax dollars?money you have already paid income tax on today. The superpower of the Roth IRA is that All Future Capital Gains, Dividends, and Growth Compound One Hundred Percent Tax-Free, and All Withdrawals in Retirement Are Completely Tax-Free.",
