    "In a standard taxable account, when you withdraw that one point five million dollars, you would owe hundreds of thousands of dollars in capital gains taxes. Inside a Roth IRA, you pay Zero Dollars in taxes. You withdraw the entire one point five million dollars tax-free. That single account wrapper legally saves you hundreds of thousands of dollars in tax liabilities.",
